{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Frontline: Afrika Korps</strong>\ud83c\udf34</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=\u272a=\u00a0Command the deserts in <strong>Frontline: Afrika Korps</strong>, a gripping WWII strategy game set in the scorching <strong>North African campaig</strong>n. Lead the legendary <strong>Afrika Korps</strong> or the\u00a0<strong>Allied Desert Rats\u00a0</strong>through intense, historical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076070/extras/a227bbd5198a0ce7ffec7698d81e5b9c.avif?t=1774708823\" width=796 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=\u272a= Lead the forces of <strong>Italy,  Wehrmacht,  Commonwealth</strong>, and the <strong>USA</strong>, each with unique playstyles, tactics, and historical authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2630 Engage in meticulously crafted historical missions across serene yet deadly desert maps, where every dune and oasis can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdc Build your army with a mix of <strong>core units</strong>, specialized <strong>support</strong> troops, and <strong>elite</strong> special units, each customizable with level-ups and unique <strong>abilities</strong> to enhance their battlefield prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=\u2605=\u00a0 From <strong>Rommel\u2019s Afrika Korps\u00a0</strong>to <strong>Montgomery\u2019s Desert Rats</strong>, lead iconic forces through dynamic campaigns, leveraging strategy, resource management, and tactical cunning to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rewrite history or hold the line? The deserts of Africa await your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076070/extras/1c72d9598abcbd40b5efb0581740d754.poster.avif?t=1774708823\" width=800 height=173 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076070/extras/1c72d9598abcbd40b5efb0581740d754.webm?t=1774708823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\u00a0Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Italy, Wehrmacht, Commonwealth, or USA</strong> in historically inspired campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across stunning desert maps, from Syria\u2019s rugged terrains to Tunisia\u2019s coastal strongholds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command diverse rosters of core units, support troops, and unique special units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your units and unlock powerful abilities to tailor your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience authentic <strong>WWII tactics</strong> with deep strategic gameplay and dynamic battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Friends, the &quot;Frontline Games Series&quot; is a SOLO Dev effort, I answer and appreciate all feedback.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>*If you are a player of Turn-based Strategy &amp; tactics Hex-grid WW2 Wargames, this game might be for you!&quot;</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2605 <i>Thank you for Wish-listing!</i>\u2605</strong> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076070?t=1774708823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076070/f2095ed52828b075d4bb874981a681633faf6b93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774708823","capsule_image":"https://shared.ak